<title>FRANCE: Social pact same weight as budget pact - French.</title>
<headline>Social pact same weight as budget pact - French.</headline>
<text>
<p>POITIERS, France, June 13 - A European Union jobs and growth pact proposed by France must have the same weight as the stability pact limiting budget deficits, a French government source said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;The social aspect cannot be an annexe, it has to have the same weight as the stability pact,&quot; the source told reporters after a Franco-German summit here.</p>
<p>France and Germany failed to reach a final accord at the meeting on the pact, which imposes budget control under monetary union.</p>
</text>
